{"seq":1,"slug":"neighbor-sampling","title":"邻居采样与小批量训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/training/neighbor-sampling","wordCount":1445,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"邻居采样与小批量训练\">邻居采样与小批量训练</h1><p><a href=\"../architectures/gcn\">GCN</a> 的训练有个隐藏的霸道前提：它把整张图和所有节点表示一次性塞进显存做整图（full-batch）梯度下降。在 Cora 那种几千节点的图上没问题，可一旦图有上百万节点，显存瞬间爆掉。更糟的是，GNN 有个独特的「邻居爆炸」难题——你想算一个节点的表示，要先算它邻居的表示，又要先算邻居的邻居……层数一深，需要的节点数指数级膨胀。这一篇讲清楚怎么把 GNN 的训练切成可控的小批量。它承接 <a href=\"../architectures/graphsage-gat\">GraphSAGE</a> 的采样思想。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-邻居爆炸问题\">核心概念：邻居爆炸问题</h2><p>普通深度学习的小批量很简单：随便挑 256 个样本，它们彼此独立。但图上的节点不独立——算节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 层表示，需要它 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 跳邻域内的<strong>所有</strong>节点都参与计算。</p>\n<p>设平均度数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，那么一个节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 层计算要触及约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}^L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个节点。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d} = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时，单个目标节点就牵连 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>125000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50^3 = 125000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">125000</span></span></span></span></span> 个节点。一个 batch 几百个目标节点，触及的节点数轻松破百万——这就是<strong>邻居爆炸</strong>，它让朴素的小批量化失效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    V[&quot;目标节点 v&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;1 跳邻居&lt;br/&gt;~d̄ 个&quot;]&#10;    L1 --&gt; L2[&quot;2 跳邻居&lt;br/&gt;~d̄² 个&quot;]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L3[&quot;3 跳邻居&lt;br/&gt;~d̄³ 个 → 爆炸&quot;]&#10;    L3 --&gt; P[&quot;显存与计算&lt;br/&gt;指数级膨胀&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    V[\"目标节点 v\"] --&gt; L1[\"1 跳邻居&lt;br/&gt;~d̄ 个\"]\n    L1 --&gt; L2[\"2 跳邻居&lt;br/&gt;~d̄² 个\"]\n    L2 --&gt; L3[\"3 跳邻居&lt;br/&gt;~d̄³ 个 → 爆炸\"]\n    L3 --&gt; P[\"显存与计算&lt;br/&gt;指数级膨胀\"]</pre><p>采样的全部意义，就是把这个指数膨胀的感受野裁剪到可控规模。三大类采样策略各从不同维度下刀。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采样策略</th>\n<th>下刀维度</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>邻居爆炸</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点级采样</td>\n<td>每节点固定采 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个邻居</td>\n<td>GraphSAGE</td>\n<td>仍随层数膨胀（但有上限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级采样</td>\n<td>每层固定采一批节点</td>\n<td>FastGCN</td>\n<td>不膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子图采样</td>\n<td>整个 batch 在一个子图内</td>\n<td>GraphSAINT、Cluster-GCN</td>\n<td>不膨胀</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"节点级采样-graphsage-的做法\">节点级采样：GraphSAGE 的做法</h2><p>最直接的思路来自 <a href=\"../architectures/graphsage-gat\">GraphSAGE</a>：每个节点在每一层只随机采固定数量的邻居。比如设定每层采 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>25</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[25, 10]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>——第一层每个目标节点采 25 个邻居，第二层每个再采 10 个。这把感受野从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}^L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压成了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_l k_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这个<strong>与图密度无关的常数</strong>。</p>\n<p>它的好处是实现简单、天然支持归纳。但缺点也明显：跨层之间邻居是独立采的，浅层节点会被重复采样，存在<strong>计算冗余</strong>；而且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>l</mi></msub><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_l k_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍随层数指数增长（只是底数小了），深层 GNN 时依然吃力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"层级采样-打破层间冗余\">层级采样：打破层间冗余</h2><p>FastGCN（2018）换了个角度：不为每个节点单独采邻居，而是<strong>每一层独立地、整体地</strong>采一批节点（比如每层固定采 400 个）。这一层所有目标节点都从这同一批采样节点里取邻居，于是无论目标节点多少，每层的计算量都被钉死，邻居爆炸被彻底掐断。</p>\n<p>为了让采样无偏，FastGCN 把图卷积写成对节点分布的积分形式，再用重要性采样估计——度数高的节点被采到的概率更大。它的风险是：随机采的一批节点之间可能<strong>没几条边</strong>，导致采样出的子图太稀疏、方差大。后续的 LADIES 等方法通过「依赖上层已采节点来约束下层采样」来缓解这个稀疏问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"子图采样-graphsaint-与-cluster-gcn\">子图采样：GraphSAINT 与 Cluster-GCN</h2><p>第三类思路最干脆：每个 batch 先<strong>采样出一个完整的子图</strong>，然后在这个子图上做标准的整图 GNN，batch 之间换不同子图。这样邻居爆炸根本不会发生，因为计算被限制在子图内部。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cluster-GCN</strong>（2019）：先用图聚类算法（METIS）把大图切成若干稠密簇，每个 batch 取一个或几个簇。簇内边密集，信息流动充分；缺点是切割丢掉了跨簇的边。</li>\n<li><strong>GraphSAINT</strong>（2020）：用随机游走或边/节点采样器构造子图，并对聚合做归一化校正以保证无偏，方差更小，是目前子图采样的强基线。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>子图采样的最大优点是 GPU 利用率高（一个稠密子图 = 一次高效的整图运算），也最适合往 <a href=\"scalability\">大规模图扩展</a> 上推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采样带来的偏差与方差\">采样带来的偏差与方差</h2><p>采样不是免费的——它在「省显存」和「估计准确」之间做权衡。采的邻居越少，方差越大、梯度越噪，可能损害收敛和最终精度；采得越多越接近整图但越贵。实践中的几条经验：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浅层（靠近输入）多采、深层少采，因为深层节点数已经少了。</li>\n<li>推断时尽量用全邻居（不采样），只在训练时采样——训练求快，推断求准。</li>\n<li>子图采样配合归一化校正（GraphSAINT 式）通常比朴素节点采样方差更小。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论哪种采样，它都只解决了「单卡能否跑起来」的问题。当图大到单机都装不下、或要在多卡多机上训练时，还需要图分区、特征预计算等更重的手段，这正是下一篇 <a href=\"scalability\">大规模图扩展</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GNN 的邻居爆炸：算一个节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 层表示需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}^L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个节点参与，使朴素小批量化失效。</li>\n<li>节点级采样（GraphSAGE）每节点每层采固定邻居，简单归纳但仍随层数膨胀、有冗余。</li>\n<li>层级采样（FastGCN）每层整体采一批节点，钉死每层计算量，但子图可能过稀疏。</li>\n<li>子图采样（Cluster-GCN、GraphSAINT）每 batch 在一个完整子图内训练，GPU 利用率高、最易扩展。</li>\n<li>采样在显存与方差间权衡：浅层多采、推断用全邻居、子图采样配归一化校正。</li>\n<li>采样解决单卡可行性；图分区与预计算等更重手段见 <a href=\"scalability\">大规模图扩展</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"邻居采样与小批量训练","id":"邻居采样与小批量训练"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：邻居爆炸问题","id":"核心概念-邻居爆炸问题"},{"level":2,"text":"节点级采样：GraphSAGE 的做法","id":"节点级采样-graphsage-的做法"},{"level":2,"text":"层级采样：打破层间冗余","id":"层级采样-打破层间冗余"},{"level":2,"text":"子图采样：GraphSAINT 与 Cluster-GCN","id":"子图采样-graphsaint-与-cluster-gcn"},{"level":2,"text":"采样带来的偏差与方差","id":"采样带来的偏差与方差"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图 Transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/architectures/graph-transformers"},"next":{"title":"大规模图扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/training/scalability"}}